    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d436">

                <pb facs="0537" n="527" sameAs="frus:frus1944v02/pg527"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.796/8–944</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Counselor of the Belgian Embassy</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gruben</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Chief of the
                        Aviation Division</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">D. 8443/8 <lb/> No. 3778</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-08-09">August 9, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Morgan</hi>: I acknowledge with thanks the
                    receipt of your letter of August 5, 1944, enclosing, for the information of the
                    Belgian group participating in the exploratory talks on aviation next Monday, an
                    informal summary of the American objectives.</p>
                <p>You will find attached hereto, for the information of the members of the American
                    group, a similar informal summary of the objectives favored by my Government in
                    the same field.</p>
                <p>There is also enclosed herewith this Embassy’s note informing the State
                    Department of the composition of the Belgian group.<anchor n="73"
                        xml:id="d436-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hervé de Gruben</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d436-a1.xml" xpointer="d436-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
